+## 5. `src/features/background-agent/manager.ts` — Enforce global limit
+
+### In `launch()` method — add check before task creation (after `reserveSubagentSpawn`):
+
+```typescript
+  async launch(input: LaunchInput): Promise<BackgroundTask> {
