+# Code Changes
+
+## File 1: `src/config/schema/comment-checker.ts`
+
+### Before
+```typescript
+import { z } from "zod"
+
+export const CommentCheckerConfigSchema = z.object({
+  /** Custom prompt to replace the default warning message. Use {{comments}} placeholder for detected comments XML. */
